    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack are delighted to bring to the market No. 20 Beech Road, Rivercourt, Carlow Town.\n\n***For investors, this property offers the attractive combination of an established tenancy and a substantial lease term remaining, providing the potential for a long-term, secure investment with minimal void risk.***\n\nInvestment Highlights:\nThree-bedroom residential property\nTenants in situ\nApproximately 13 years remaining on the lease\nEstablished and popular residential development\nConvenient location close to Carlow Town centre\nExcellent access to local amenities, schools and transport links\nIdeal opportunity for both existing and first-time property investors\n\nThis three-bedroom property presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located residential investment property with the significant benefit of tenants in situ and approximately 13 years remaining on the existing lease.\n\nSituated in the popular Rivercourt development, the property is ideally located within easy reach of Carlow Town centre and all the amenities the town has to offer. There is a wide range of shops, schools, restaurants, leisure facilities and transport links close by, while Carlow's major employment and educational centres are also readily accessible.\n\nThe property comprises three bedrooms and offers well-proportioned residential accommodation within this established development.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended for investors seeking a long-term residential investment with an existing tenancy in place.\n\nFor further information, please contact DNG McCormack. 0599133800."
      },
